n Aug 16, 12:00&#8211;6:00pm</span>. Frank H. Ogawa Plaza and surrounding blocks, Oakland. Festival admission is ticketed (parade is free to watch). 12th St BART empties directly into the plaza. <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/oakland-pride-parade-festival-2026-tickets-1988128686420" style="color:#1f5fbf;">Tickets</a> <span style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#5d6d76;font-style:italic;">good for: a Sunday that starts at noon and ends at six</span>
