      <b>Perseid meteor shower &#8212; peak nights</b> &#8212; the year's most dependable meteor shower, peaking overnight <span style="color:#17313b;font-weight:bold;">Wed Aug 12 into the small hours of Thu Aug 13</span>. <span style="color:#7a3ea8;font-weight:bold;">Free</span>. You have to leave the city: the Marina Headlands (Hawk Hill, Battery 129), Mount Tamalpais' Rock Spring, or Mount Diablo's summit road. <b>The catch is fog, not clouds</b> &#8212; the coastal marine layer often sits below the ridgelines, so going up is usually the answer. Check the summit webcams before driving, dress for 45&#176;F, and give your eyes 20 minutes to adjust. <a href="https://sf.funcheap.com/city-guide/august-street-fairs-festivals/" style="color:#1f5fbf;">Local listing</a> <span style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#5d6d76;font-style:italic;">good for: a midnight drive and a thermos</span>
